{
  "name": "MCC · Links (click tracker + veto stop link)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Links\n`/webhook/go?p=<post_id>&s=instagram&m=story&d=lite&l=en` logs a click to **Clicks** and redirects to the site with UTMs\n(d = home|lite|full|sample|crystals).\n`/webhook/veto?p=<post_id>&n=<nonce>` is the private stop link the autopilot sends in veto mode;\nit records the stop in **Vetoes** and the post is not published.",
        "height": 220,
        "width": 640,
        "color": 5
      },
